==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gmh|gegen}}, from {{der|de|goh|gagan}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*gagin}}. Compare {{cog|is|gegn}}, {{cog|nl|tegen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɡe.ɡən/|[ˈɡeː.ɡn̩]|[ˈɡeː.ɡŋ̍]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-gegen.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Preposition===
{{head|de|preposition}} {{lb|de|+ accusative}}

# [[against]]

====Usage notes====
* Like in Middle High German, ''gegen'' was also used with the dative in older times, especially in ''Upper German''. Compare {{m|de|entgegen}}, which is still used with the dative.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|de|wider}}

